  "id": "occupational-segregation",
  "term": "occupational segregation",
  "definition": "Occupational segregation is the pattern in which one group is concentrated in different jobs or industry sectors than another group. In this context, it refers to LGBTQ* people working in different occupations and sectors than cisgender heterosexual people, possibly in part because they steer away from areas where they expect discrimination.",
